# Direct quote delivery via EmailJS; leave unset to open an email draft instead.
# Use a dedicated Patriot Messaging template with To Email fixed to
# dan@patriotmessaging.com, Reply-To {{reply_to}}, and empty CC/BCC.
# Setup and ready-to-paste content: docs/emailjs/README.md.
# All three values must come from the account that owns this template.
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_do0b6qd
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=

VITE_SITE_URL=https://patriotmessaging.com
